"""Verifier for the bioequivalence correction task (Scientific Computing).

Expectations are recomputed here, independently of the reference program, from an embedded copy of the
shipped corpus (the verifier container has no agent input directory) and from structurally shifted
corpora that an embedded corpus builder writes at grade time; the delivered program is re-run on each.
Numbers compare under the number rule of the shipped handbook (H21, H22). Negative checks hold when the
named wrong path is present.
"""
